eports behind enemy and auto-attacks\n\n\n Visuals\n\nESP — boxes, names, distance, health bar, tracers, head dot, skeleton\nChams — highlights enemies through walls via Highlight instance\nCrosshair — custom crosshair overlay (Cross / Dot / Circle / T-Shape)\nArrow Indicators — arrows on screen edge pointing to off-screen enemies\n\n\n Movement\n\nSpeed — walk speed multiplier (Hold / Toggle / Always)\nFly — free flight with WASD + Space / Shift\nNo Fall Damage — blocks fall damage state\n\n\n Misc\n\nAnti-AFK — clicks every few seconds to prevent kick\nTeleport to Cursor — teleports character to mouse hit position\nBring Unanchored — pulls nearby unanchored parts toward player\nHitbox Expander — scales each body part hitbox independently (R6 + R15)\nServer Hop — joins a different server with open slots\nRejoin — rejoins the current place\nConfig Sharing — exports / imports full config via clipboard\nWar Tycoon TP — teleports to capture point, press again to return\n\n\n Settings\n\nWatermark — FPS, ping, online counter overlay (Default / Minimal / Large)\nNotifications — toggle sounds and style (Default / Minimal / Accent)\nTheme — full theme control via LinoriaLib ThemeManager\nConfig Save — save and load named configs via SaveManager\nUID — unique persistent user ID with clipboard copy\nOnline Counter — live session count via countapi.xyz","tags":["War Tycoon","NeverPuzo"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/HfFw48Qx","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6957b13fd2a92a3bd756874e","username":"NeverPuzo","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7591ed878ba99dd9ae45356fd8e73793ad606eaf0daf8dbb482b7ef2dae69968.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6957b13fd2a92a3bd756874e-1767453913804.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6957b13fd2a92a3bd756874e","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7591ed878ba99dd9ae45356fd8e73793ad606eaf0daf8dbb482b7ef2dae69968.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.co